atched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEAFAF093FE96DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1525504014:1":{"text":"이런 학자 때문에 보칼리스의 미래가 깜깜한 거야.","source_cn":"有你这样的学者，呼临城才是真的没有未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD9CEBF4C50A23F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1525504015:1":{"text":"당신...!","source_cn":"你……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3160C4971E28D228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1525504015":{"text":"당신...!","source_cn":"你……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3160C4971E28D228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1525504016:0":{"text":"맞아요... 저는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 모르간을 믿어요.","source_cn":"没错，我相信<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F7FA9B79D7BB919","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아요... 저는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 모르간을 믿어요.","female":"맞아요... 저는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(와)과 모르간을 믿어요.","variant_male_record_index":"194919","variant_female_record_index":"194920","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1525504018:0":{"text":"비보 선생님, 어떤 방식이든 죽거나 다치는 백성